=== Valid candidates that withdrew ===

* Veljko Džakula, the leader of a non-governmental organization Serbian Democratic Forum, entered the race<ref>{{cite web |url=http://izbori.tportal.hr/kandidati/40597/Prvi-i-jedini-manjinski-predsjednicki-kandidat.html |title=Prvi i jedini manjinski predsjednički kandidat- 2010 predsjednički izbori – tportal.hr |work=T-portal |language=hr |date=2009-10-23 |access-date=2009-12-25 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20091212204514/http://izbori.tportal.hr/kandidati/40597/Prvi-i-jedini-manjinski-predsjednicki-kandidat.html |archive-date=2009-12-12 |url-status=live }}</ref> and became a candidate of three Croatian Serb parties: [[Serb People's Party (Croatia)|Serb People's Party]], [[Democratic Party of Serbs (Croatia)|Democratic Party of Serbs]] and [[New Serb Party]] (Nova srpska stranka). He submitted 10,557 signatures to the electoral commission on November 16. However, he then withdrew on November 17.

=== Failed candidacies ===

